          "name_ru": "Кеен Смелл",
          "parent": "a5e-mm_diseased-giant-rat",
          "ru_source": "derived"
        },
        {
          "desc": "The giant rat has advantage on attack rolls against a creature if at least one of the rats allies is within 5 feet of the creature and not incapacitated.",
